{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18105040","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18105040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1810504001:0":{"text":"是塞塞塞塞涅小姐本人……！真真真真真漂亮啊……","source_cn":"是塞塞塞塞涅小姐本人……！真真真真真漂亮啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7742FFDE5637DC31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810504002:0":{"text":"对不起，塞涅小姐，我们没看到你过来……刚才没伤着你吧？","source_cn":"对不起，塞涅小姐，我们没看到你过来……刚才没伤着你吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F241E9408E6BB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810504003:0":{"text":"差一点就伤着了！有一支箭就落在塞涅脚边！","source_cn":"差一点就伤着了！有一支箭就落在塞涅脚边！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A2197BCA16F15F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810504004:0":{"text":"啊？！对不起对不起对不起！塞涅小姐，我们不是故意的！","source_cn":"啊？！对不起对不起对不起！塞涅小姐，我们不是故意的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3D0D44CB3E1583D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810504005:0":{"text":"请不必紧张，我不会将刚才发生的事告诉苔佩希阁下。","source_cn":"请不必紧张，我不会将刚才发生的事告诉苔佩希阁下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24B4D918F5A40E0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810504006:0":{"text":"作为交换，可否请你们高抬贵手，放过面前这几位朋友？","source_cn":"作为交换，可否请你们高抬贵手，放过面前这几位朋友？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC34CC7E7BA4FF27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810504007:1":{"text":"这……可是他们和修缮屋有关，行迹可疑……","source_cn":"这……可是他们和修缮屋有关，行迹可疑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3EE3E5607091EDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810504008:0":{"text":"好啊，你们不放人，那我就告诉所有人，你说了领主的坏话！","source_cn":"好啊，你们不放人，那我就告诉所有人，你说了领主的坏话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F739DF5372B6F86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810504009:1":{"text":"你——你这是诬陷！","source_cn":"你——你这是诬陷！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71557978C099D9AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810504010:0":{"text":"有吗？不知道领主阁下更愿意听塞涅小姐的话，还是你们这些普通守卫的话。","source_cn":"有吗？不知道领主阁下更愿意听塞涅小姐的话，还是你们这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECDE2D0969152951","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810504011:0":{"text":"他们是曾看过我“忌辰”演出的观众，甚至还有一位曾是主演，并不是坏人。请各位通融一下吧。","source_cn":"他们是曾看过我